On Saturday 27 September 2003 20:13 INS wrote:

> My question is, (and I have not looked hard yet) how do I get into the
> quest?

- You need to be level 14 or higher.
- You need to be piously aligned. If you haven't been doing horrible
things like killing peaceful humans, you're very likely to be piously
aligned if you're level 14 or higher, so don't worry. If you do worry,
apply a stethoscope to yourself or zap a wand/quaff a potion of
enlightenment, or probe yourself with a wand of probing.
- You need to find the magic portal on the level where you get the
message, and go through it, and talk to your leader.
- You need to be your original starting alignment (your quest leader
isn't fooled by a helm of opposite alignment; they're smarter than
gods). If you've converted yourself at an altar, you're screwed.

Note that the entrance to the rest of the quest is on the level you talk
to your leader on, *not anywhere else in the dungeon*.

